{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "418c60e6-4a6f-8e8e-8980-9b9acc89e3bd",
  "created_at": "2026-02-27T11:30:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Rivera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I'm calling about some trash that got left out on the curb. [line breaks up] Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little choppy, but I've got you. Go ahead, what's out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the landlord, the guy who owns the place next to mine, he had a tenant move out, and he left a whole pile on the curb. A mattress, a couple of chairs, some boxes, and a broken dresser. It's been there since Wednesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so bulk waste after a move-out. And where's this at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's two seventy-five Rhode Island Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, did you say two seventy-five?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, two seven five. Rhode Island Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two seven five Rhode Island Avenue, got it. I'm writing that down. Mattress, chairs, dresser, boxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, yeah. And I wanted to ask when the next pickup is, because I don't know if they'll take all that or if it just sits there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, your regular trash day depends on the street. Let me pull it up. Rhode Island Avenue, hang on a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's a Monday pickup on your side. So the next one is this coming Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, [crosstalk] did you say one day or, um, the number one? I heard \"fun day.\" The line is crackling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. M-O-N-day. This coming Monday, March second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, Monday. Okay. Ha, I thought you said something about a fun day. Sorry, I lost track of what I was going to say. Oh, right. Will they take the mattress?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk items like that usually need to be scheduled or tagged, they don't always go with the regular truck. I'll put in a note for a crew to check the pile, and I'd say that's the better route than waiting on Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that sounds good. Should I call back, or will somebody come out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody should go look at it. If you want, I can take a number in case they have questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four zero one, five five five, zero one nine two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-two. Got it. And it's Luis?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:30:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Luis Rivera, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, Luis, I've got it noted for two seventy-five Rhode Island Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you very much. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-27T11:30:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
